<!-- ==== Redna poletna ladijska linija Ankaran - Koper - Izola - Piran: enkratna vozovnica ======
     (Regular summer sea route Ankaran - Koper - Izola - Piran: single ticket)
Fare products of the seasonal passenger boat between the coastal towns Ankaran, Koper, Izola and Piran, in
NeTEx (validated against the v2.1-wip-efip XSD), following the profile of Slovenia_IJPP_GeneralTickets.xml:
  - enkratna vozovnica za ladjo (single ticket between two piers), for adults and children;
  - prevoz kolesa (bicycle supplement), one bicycle per person, limited space on board.
  Tickets are bought on board; there is no smart card or online sale.
File: examples/standards/efip/Slovenia_CoastalBoat_SingleTicket.xml (branch v2.1-wip-efip).

MODELLING
=========
- Relacija med pomoloma (pier to pier) -> one DistanceMatrixElement per relation and direction between the four
    piers (6 relations x 2 directions = 12); the price depends only on the relation, not on the direction.
- Ladijski prevoz (boat) -> TransportModes water, WaterSubmode localPassengerFerry, in the access element.
- Sezona (season) -> a ValidDuring validity condition on the Tariff: the 2025 season (1 July to 7 September 2025)
    with DaysOfWeek Tuesday to Sunday ("daily except Mondays").
- Popust za otroke (child discount) -> UserProfiles adult (14 and over) and child under 14 (50%), with UserType
    adult / child and the age limits, DiscountingRules 0% / 50%.
- Prevoz kolesa (bicycle) -> a SupplementProduct tied to the single ticket (FareProductRef), with a
    LuggageAllowance (BaggageType bicycle, at most 1 item, charged by item, EUR 1.00 regardless of the relation).
- Vozovnica na ladji (on-board ticket) -> a paper ticket bought on board, one SalesOfferPackage for both products.
- Cene (prices) -> one FareTable for the single ticket (one Cell per DistanceMatrixElement and UserProfile,
    24 cells) and one for the bicycle supplement.

DATA SOURCE
===========
- Season, stops, prices, child discount and bicycle fare: notice of the Interreg Italy-Slovenia programme,
  30 June 2025, https://www.ita-slo.eu/en/news-and-events/news/boat-transports-passengers-and-bicycles-between-ankaran-koper-izola-and-piran
  (organised by the Regional Development Centre Koper, boat Zlatoperka, circular route twice a day).
- Earlier seasons (photo of the price board on board, earlier season) had lower fares:
  Ankaran-Koper 2.00, Ankaran-Izola 3.00, Ankaran-Piran 5.00, Koper-Izola 3.00, Koper-Piran 4.00, Izola-Piran 3.00,
  bicycle 1.00 (EUR). This file uses the 2025 fares, the latest officially published.
- The piers are not in the NAP.si stop place export of 2026-09-25 (no water stops are published), so the stop
  places are created for this example, without coordinates.

CONVENTIONS
===========
- ids follow the Slovenian NAP profile, "SI:SI0:<Class>:<uuid>:IJPP" (frames ":NAP"); all objects are created
  for this example and use the uuid block "1177-00f1" (the IJPP example uses "1177-00f0").
- PublicationDelivery version "2.1:EFIP" = NeTEx 2.1 + EFIP profile (provisional identifier).
-->
